      "side": 1,
      "message": "Stupid questions: \n1. It seems to me this is not very healthy in long term to support such API.\nIs it possible in future this API is abused, and we need another USE_MORE_RESTRICTED_NETWORKS permission to restrict these uids?\n2. For the examples below, can they be satisfied by using mOwnerUid or mRequestorUid?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1665,
        "startChar": 54,
        "endLine": 1666,
        "endChar": 98
      },
      "revId": "78ac4b4447b8dca2442e895d7e69c1c990ef13de",
